560	     *  keeps its date, takes the next number in the sequence it is numbered in (a draft, having none,
561	     *  gets none; its old number is never used again) and loses any figure a statement bound it to (it is live again until
562	     *  its new person's next statement). Refused unless the sheet's permission matrix allows the user's
563	     *  role to reassign (by default, a steward), and for a
564	     *  settled or voided claim, a claim dated inside a closed period, a move to the claim's own person,
565	     *  to a person retired by the claim's date, or to a person by whose terms a claim added on its date
566	     *  would be due inside a closed period (the claim's own due-by stays as it was fixed). */
